	(text "XIAO ESP32-C6 pin use (footprint also accepts XIAO ESP32-S3 / C3):\n  D0 (GPIO0, ADC)  CC1 sense\n  D1 (GPIO1, ADC)  CC2 sense\n  D2 (GPIO2, ADC)  NTC sense\n  D3 (GPIO21)      RGB data out\n  D8 (GPIO19)      White LED PWM -> U2 (LGS63032EP) EN\n  D6/D7 left free (UART), D4/D5/D9/D10 spare\nOn-module: GPIO3 = RF switch enable (drive LOW), GPIO14 = antenna select\n(LOW = on-board ceramic, HIGH = U.FL). Bottom-side module pads are not used."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
